#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:105
msgid "Inpainting Photograph Tool"
msgstr "इनपेन्ट फोटोग्राफ उपकरण"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:106
msgid "You need to select a region to inpaint to use this tool"
msgstr "तपाईँले इनपेन्ट गर्न यो उपकरण प्रयोग गर्न एउटा क्षेत्र चयन गर्नुपर्दछ"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:123 imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:142
#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:169
msgid "Photograph Inpainting"
msgstr "इनपेन्ट फोटोग्राफ"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:127
msgid "&Save As..."
msgstr "यस रुपमा बचत गर्नुहोस्..."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:128
msgid "&Load..."
msgstr "लोड..."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:132
msgid "<p>Reset all filter parameters to their default values."
msgstr "<p>सबै फिल्टर परिमितिहरूका पूर्वनिर्धारित मानमा तिनीहरूलाई रिसेट गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:133
msgid "<p>Load all filter parameters from settings text file."
msgstr "<p>सेटिङ पाठ फाइलबाट सबै फिल्टर परिमिति लोड गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:134
msgid "<p>Save all filter parameters to settings text file."
msgstr "<p>सेटिङ पाठ फाइलमा सबै फिल्टर परिमिति बचत गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:144
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to inpaint a photograph."
msgstr "फोटोग्राफ इनपेन्ट गर्ने डिजिक्याम छवि प्लगइन ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:150
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "लेखक र सम्भारकर्ता"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:153
msgid "CImg library"
msgstr "CImg लाइब्रेरी"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:156
msgid "Feedback and plugin polishing"
msgstr "पृष्ठपोषण र प्लगइन पोलिसिङ"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:162
msgid "Plugin Handbook"
msgstr "प्लगइन हातेपुस्तक"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:179
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "प्रिसेट"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:187
msgid "Visit CImg library website"
msgstr "CImg लाइब्रेरी वेबसाइट अवलोकन गर्नुहोस्"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:189
msgid "Filtering type:"
msgstr "फिल्टर प्रकार:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:192
msgid "None"
msgstr "कुनै पनि होइन"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:193
msgid "Remove Small Artefact"
msgstr "साना शिल्पकृति हटाउनुहोस्"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:194
msgid "Remove Medium Artefact"
msgstr "मध्यम शिल्पकृति हटाउनुहोस्"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:195
msgid "Remove Large Artefact"
msgstr "ठूला शिल्पकृति हटाउनुहोस्"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:196
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the filter preset to use for photograph "
"restoration:<p><b>None</b>: Most common values. Puts settings to "
"default.<p><b>Remove Small Artefact</b>: inpaint small image artefact like "
"image glitch.<p><b>Remove Medium Artefact</b>: inpaint medium image "
"artefact.<p><b>Remove Large Artefact</b>: inpaint image artefact like "
"unwanted object.<p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>फोटोग्राफ पुन: प्राप्ति प्रयोग गर्न यहाँ फिल्टर प्रिसेट चयन "
"गर्नुहोस्:<p><b>कुनै पनि होइन</b>: धेरै साझा मानहरू । सेटिङलाई पूर्वनिर्धारितमा राख्नुहोस् ।<p><b>साना शिल्पकृति हटाउनुहोस्</b>: छवि ग्लिच जस्तै साना छवि "
"शिल्पकृति इनपेन्ट गर्नुहोस् ।<p><b>मध्यम शिल्पकृति हटाउनुहोस्</b>: मध्यम छवि "
"शिल्पकृति इनपेन्ट गर्नुहोस् ।<p><b>ठूला शिल्पकृति हटाउनुहोस्</b>: अनावश्यक वस्तु जस्तै "
"छवि शिल्पकृति पेन्ट गर्नुहोस् ।<p>"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:208
msgid "<p>This is the current percentage of the task completed."
msgstr "<p>कार्य समाप्तिको यो हालको प्रतिशत हो ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:216
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr "महीन"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:218
msgid "Detail preservation:"
msgstr "विवरण सुरक्षा:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:223
msgid ""
"<p>Preservation of details to set the sharpening level of the small features "
"in the target image. Higher values leave details sharp."
msgstr "<p>लक्ष्य छविका साना विशेषताको राम्रोपना स्तर सेट गर्न विवरणको सुरक्षा । उच्च मानले विवरणलाई राम्रो बनाएर छोड्दछ ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:229
msgid "Anisotropy:"
msgstr "एनिसोट्रोपी:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:234
msgid ""
"<p>Anisotropic (directional) modifier of the details. Keep it small for "
"Gaussian noise."
msgstr "<p>विवरणको एनिसोट्रोपिक (दिशासूचक) परिमार्जक । गाउसियन आवजका लागि यसलाई सानो राख्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:238
msgid "Smoothing:"
msgstr "महीन:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:243
msgid ""
"<p>Total smoothing power: if Detail Factor sets the relative smoothing and "
"Gradient Factor the direction, Time Step sets the overall effect."
msgstr "<p>कूल महीन सामर्थ्य: यदि विवरण कारकले सापेक्षिक महीन र ग्रेडियन्ट कारक दिशा सेट गर्दछ भने, समय चरणले समग्र प्रभाव सेट गर्दछ ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:248
msgid "Regularity:"
msgstr "नियमितता:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:253
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls the smoothing regularity of the target image. Do not "
"use an high value here, else the target image will be completely blurred."
msgstr ""
"<p>यो मानले लक्ष्य छविको महीन नियमितता नियन्त्रण गर्दछ । यहाँ उच्च मान "
"प्रयोग नगर्नुहोस्, अन्यथा लक्ष्य छवि पूर्ण रूपमा अस्पष्ट हुन्छ ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:259
msgid "Iterations:"
msgstr "पुनरावृत्ति:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:264
msgid "<p>Sets the number of times the filter is applied on the target image."
msgstr "<p>लक्ष्य छविमा फिल्टर लागू गरिने संख्या सेट गर्दछ ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:272
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "उन्नत सेटिङ"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:274
msgid "Angular step:"
msgstr "कोणीय चरण:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:279
msgid "<p>Set here the angular integration step in degrees in analogy to anisotropy."
msgstr "<p>एनिसोट्रोपीमा समान रुपको कोणीय एकिकरण चरण डिग्रीमा सेट गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:283
msgid "Integral step:"
msgstr "पूरा चरण:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:288
msgid "<p>Set here the spatial integral step. Stay below 1."
msgstr "<p>स्पाटिएल पूरा चरण यहाँ सेट गर्नुहोस् । १ तल रहनुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:292
msgid "Gaussian:"
msgstr "गाउसियन:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:297
msgid "<p>Set here the precision of the Gaussian function."
msgstr "<p>गाउसियन प्रकार्यको शुद्धता यहाँ सेट गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:301
msgid "Use linear interpolation"
msgstr "लिनियर इन्टरपोलेसन प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:302
msgid "<p>Enable this option to quench the last bit of quality (slow)."
msgstr "<p>गुणको अन्तिम बिट नष्ट गर्न यो विकल्प सक्षम पार्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:305
msgid "Normalize photograph"
msgstr "फोटोग्राफ सामान्यीकरण"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:306
msgid "<p>Enable this option to process an output image normalization."
msgstr "<p>निर्गत छवि सामान्यीकरण प्रक्रिया गर्न यो विकल्प सक्षम पार्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:550
msgid "InPainting"
msgstr "इनपेन्टिङ"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:575
msgid "Photograph Inpainting Settings File to Load"
msgstr "लोड गर्ने फोटोग्राफ इनपेन्टरिङ सेटिङ फाइल"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:587
msgid "\"%1\" is not a Photograph Inpainting settings text file."
msgstr "\"%1\" फोटोग्राफ इनपेन्टिङ सेटिङ पाठ फाइल होइन ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:608
msgid "Cannot load settings from the Photograph Inpainting text file."
msgstr "फोटोग्राफ इनपेन्टिङ पाठ फाइलबाट सेटिङ लोड गर्न सकिँदैन ।"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:617
msgid "Photograph Inpainting Settings File to Save"
msgstr "बचत गर्ने फोटोग्राफ इनपेन्टिङ सेटिङ फाइल"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:639
msgid "Cannot save settings to the Photograph Inpainting text file."
msgstr "फोटोग्राफ इनपेन्टिङ पाठ फाइलमा सेटिङ बचत गर्न सकिँदैन ।"

#: imageplugin_inpainting.cpp:41
msgid "Inpainting..."
msgstr "इनपेन्टिङ..."

#: imageplugin_inpainting.cpp:46
msgid ""
"This filter can be used to inpaint a part in a photo. Select a region to "
"inpaint to use this option."
msgstr "यो फिल्टरलाई फोटोमा एउटा भाग इनपेन्ट गर्न प्रयोग गर्न सकिनेछ । इनपेन्ट गर्न यो विकल्प प्रयोग गर्न क्षेत्र चयन गर्नुहोस् ।"

